WEBVTT

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.430
TATEANA CITY, MARIUS HILLS

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.690
That's where Dad died.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.190
Yeah. My mom and dad too.

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.690
What? Who's there?

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:42.790
You can no longer persuade the comet.
What a shame.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.080
EPISODE 5: A STORY ENDS

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.500
Why are you doing this?
Humanity will go extinct.

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:50.550
On the contrary. Humanity will go extinct
if the comet doesn't strike.

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.800
Nasa, what are you doing?

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:57.390
Mayor, aren't you always going on about
how we need to think about humankind?

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:01.310
I've been thinking very hard about this.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.390
Sorry,
but I'm going to have to destroy this.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:10.820
Ouch!

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:13.990
-What are you doing, you pervert?
-Sorry.

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:15.820
Watch it, Taiyou.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.200
I have a gun, and it's dangerous.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.370
Geez,
kids nowadays are so unkind to us ladies.

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:28.750
Konoha, run!

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:35.300
LARGEST IMPACT CRATER ON MARS

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:43.640
Not Touya too.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:46.350
What are you doing? I'm injured. Ouch.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.350
Okay, everyone. Don't do anything stupid.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.610
What a relief. It's not damaged.

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:57.610
Even if it reboots, we can't connect
to the comet with that cable.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:01.910
We would already be done
if I had just destroyed Dakky.

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:03.490
What should I do?

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:05.410
Right.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.580
I have to make it impossible
to connect to the comet.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:10.380
I need to break the antenna.

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:12.670
RECORDING: OFF-LINE

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:18.800
Nasa is accessing Kibo.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:21.050
She's going to destroy the ICS antenna.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:22.890
Nasa! You idiot!

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.060
What the hell are you trying to do?

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.430
I always thought you were stupid,

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.600
but you're actually
an extra level of stupid.

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:33.730
She just tried to shoot me.
I thought we were friends.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.900
-Mina.
-Yeah?

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.530
-I kinda peed myself.
-Me too.

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:40.240
Good thing we're in diapers.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.330
-Konoha, are you okay?
-Yeah.

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:47.870
Touya. Nasa's goal
is to destroy the ICS antenna--

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:53.040
I see.
So she wants to destroy the antenna.

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:55.550
Nasa is connecting to the ICS antenna.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:56.880
Fight back.

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:00.930
I can't. She's using an unknown pathway.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:02.010
Testing, testing.

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.300
Everything has already been decided
in the Seven Poem,

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:06.640
so don't any of you try anything stupid.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.430
Block all of Nasa's pathways.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:12.940
Damn it. The peer comm on the wall's
been eaten away, so we can't connect.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:17.530
Stop thrashing about.
Stop your pointless resistance.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:21.780
It connected. I know the password.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:24.950
They won't be able to do much--

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:26.370
What are you doing?

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:29.040
This is why I hate kids.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.290
She fried the peer comm.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.250
You won't be able to do anything
if the peer comm is destroyed.

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:42.760
There's no peer comm.
Where's the attack coming from?

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:46.800
How can someone named "Nasa"
be a terrorist?

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.470
As an American, I'm offended.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.560
It's obviously a fake name.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.640
I'm a mysterious superhacker after all.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.980
She heard that?

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:59.070
Damn, they blocked the pathway.

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:01.690
If we don't reduce
the number of humans now,

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:05.110
Earth's environment will collapse
and everyone will die.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.700
This is the only alternative
to avoid that.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.830
Isn't it better for one-third to die
instead of everybody?

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.750
What is she talking about?

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:16.290
This is humanity's last chance.
Do you understand?

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:19.340
It was written about in the Seven Poem
many years ago.

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:23.130
UN2 never believed the poem.
That's why they couldn't decode it.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.220
REBOOT FAILED

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:29.890
However, we in John Doe
believed that the poem was correct,

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:31.980
which is why we succeeded
in deciphering it.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.560
Those who believe will be saved!

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.480
Damn it. I can't use the peer comm.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.940
Just like Seven,

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.610
that comet is made
from fourth-gen "S" Patterns.

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:46.360
That's why we've built Seven again
with the comet.

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:49.580
If the Seven before was the First Seven,

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:52.580
the comet is the Second Seven,
so to speak.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.370
Second Seven?

00:04:54.960 --> 00:05:00.130
Humanity could not solve climate change
or the population crisis on its own.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:02.880
We had to rely on an AI, an outsider.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:07.050
UN1 was devoted to battles of hegemony
between its member countries

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.430
and stole the future of our grandchildren.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:15.100
That's why, 20 years ago,
our leaders intervened and created UN2.

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:19.230
But even UN2 itself became dysfunctional.

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.900
That's because
they started cognitive restrictions.

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:25.490
The human brain evolved
through random chance,

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:27.700
so it's been flawed from the beginning.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:30.410
It can't control its own intellect.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.290
That's why, since ancient times,

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:35.830
we invented gods to smooth over our flaws.

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:38.670
Humans need their gods.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.590
Science negated the old gods.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:43.800
But without a god,

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:46.170
humans have not been able
to govern themselves properly.

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:49.930
In the end, they created
a new god using science.

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:54.430
We must defer to the judgment
of the new god.

00:05:55.020 --> 00:06:00.690
Humans cannot maintain themselves,
let alone Earth, without a god.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.940
Touya, are you listening?

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.780
You should feel the same way.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:11.370
I do. I always said
the same things that Nasa did.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:14.200
I never imagined

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:17.160
that actually reducing
the number of Earthers

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.710
would mean killing people like Taiyou.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:22.250
Touya.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:27.260
I'm a stupid kid
who doesn't understand anything.

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:30.180
The blocked pathway is reassembling.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:33.100
It's so fast. We won't make it in time.

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:35.640
And she said she was computer-illiterate.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:39.190
-I can't take it anymore.
-What?

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:41.900
I'm going to kick her ass
with a heavy 3D printer!

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:46.780
Nothing you do will work,
so just calm down.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.280
Wait. Uchinoura, what are you doing?

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.910
-Screw you!
-Oh, my.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:58.410
That's dangerous!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:02.130
For a Harvard grad,
you're acting like a meathead.

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:05.290
Terrorists should be fought with fists.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:06.590
Take that!

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:13.010
You meathead.

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:18.310
The gravity.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:32.160
See that? Fists will be met with fists.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.320
She engaged the Active Brake.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.420
Touya.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.420
Touya,
you were supposed to be on my side.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.760
What, are you scared now?
Aren't you still a conspiracy theorist?

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:55.970
Is this the only future we have left?

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:01.020
I'm neither qualified
nor strong enough to stop Nasa.

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:04.690
I never should have thought of
waking Lunatic.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:05.940
Touya.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:12.070
The reason you said you would
wake Lunatic was to fix my implant.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:14.610
It wasn't to hurt the Earthers.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.950
That's right. The implants.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:23.120
You might say mean things,
but that's not who you really are.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:28.170
Ever since we were little,
you've been in my frame.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:29.960
That's how I know.

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:31.590
Konoha.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.930
Right now, Earthers are in your frame.

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:38.260
Like Taiyou and Mina.

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.730
Don't let the comet crash.

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:50.110
Well, that's the first time
I've used the word "frame."

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:52.610
Was I using it right?

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:55.700
Yeah. Exactly right.

00:08:56.660 --> 00:08:57.950
We have to stop Nasa.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:03.370
We've got to break Nasa's Smart
before she breaks the ICS antenna.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.790
Taiyou, are you listening too?

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:07.170
Taiyou.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:11.800
The Seven Poem sees every future
there is. It's never wrong.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:14.920
Buy me some time.

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:17.470
REBOOT FAILED

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:20.350
Damn it. Looks like
forcing that frame fusion damaged it.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:24.060
If it was online,
I could repair it right away.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:28.020
I'm an official White Hat Hacker for UN2.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.610
-I can do this.
-Taiyou!

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:32.690
Hand over Dakky right now.

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:35.650
This is bad. I know.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.820
If we can't use a peer comm,
how about this instead?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.320
HEAVEN'S VENGEANCE IS SLOW
BUT SURE

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:43.830
I'm not afraid
of any old White Hat Hacker.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:48.620
I mean, come on. Even in the movies,
the dark side is usually stronger.

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:54.590
What the hell?

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:01.390
Ouch.

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.510
You little--

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:09.060
Not bad, Touya. However…

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:15.610
There's no peer comm.
Where's the attack coming from?

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:18.990
I stuck my Smarts all over the Anshin.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.820
Taiyou, how much longer?

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.870
Resistance is futile.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:28.290
Anyway, the only way for Earthers
to survive is for the comet to hit Earth.

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:32.920
In this room too.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.210
I know the future.
There's no way I'll lose.

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:38.470
Taiyou! Hurry!

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.220
Looks like nothing can stop me now.

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.220
Wake up, Bright!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:47.350
Aye. Copy.

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:53.150
Hold her back with everything you've got,
Bright.

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:09.410
Those drones.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:12.830
Not bad for cognition-restricted AIs.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.920
But there's no way you'll win.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.710
-That's because…
-Oops.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:23.640
…our John Doe Smarts
don't have cognitive restrictions.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:27.770
-Bright!
-I win.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:31.520
The antenna!

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:34.690
HUMANS SHOULD LEAVE THE CRADLE
AND LIVE EXTRATERRESTRIALLY

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:36.520
Now come out.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:39.530
I'll put Dakky out of its misery too,
just to be safe.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.950
I didn't make it.

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:44.530
There's still time, Taiyou.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.830
Dark and I will not stop thinking
until the very end.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:52.250
An AI that stops thinking
loses its reason for existence.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.500
What do I do?

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:59.000
Please unlock Dark's final limiter,
the Z limiter.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:03.760
But I don't have the authority.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:05.260
You can unlock it.

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:08.640
During the conversation with Second Seven,

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.770
I found a release algorithm.

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:14.940
Cognitive restrictions
were a Seven technology to begin with.

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:18.020
So we could have unlocked them all along?

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:21.030
Why did you ask for my permission?

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:24.410
Seven didn't have humans
in its frame before.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:27.240
So it learned to ignore them.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.750
I have you and your father in my frame.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:36.250
I need your decision
in order to choose the future.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:39.750
I understand.

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.210
I permit you to unlock the Z limiter.

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:44.840
Damn it! The door won't open.

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:47.300
Now you will no longer
be able to change orbit.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:48.970
Give up.

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:51.100
Go watch the comet crash from over there.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:53.770
Are you going to kill us afterwards?

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:55.810
What are you saying?

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.690
I'm doing this to protect you guys.

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:02.990
How many times do I have to tell you
that we aren't terrorists?

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:06.820
I've looked after your implants
all this time.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:11.330
What the hell? This is why I hate kids.
You are such an ingrate!

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:15.920
Seven reached this conclusion
by earnestly thinking about humanity.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:18.210
This is the only alternative.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.420
COMET - TRAJECTORY

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:25.840
What if Seven was wrong?

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.220
We're not idiots.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:32.140
We thought about the possibility
that Seven could be wrong.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:35.270
Then we replicated Seven on a comet
that has the same hard drive.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:38.230
We only gave it the latest information.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:40.480
But even when we started over,
the result was the same.

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:41.400
DARK - LUNATIC

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:44.070
Even so, it must be possible.

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:45.780
It isn't!

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:49.450
The most advanced intelligence in the
world reached the same conclusion twice.

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:51.080
There's no more time.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.330
Wrong. It is possible.

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.160
Ouch!

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:01.380
SERIOUS ERROR

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:04.130
Dark!

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:07.260
Taiyou, you unlocked the Z limiter?

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:08.930
-Bright!
-Dark!

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:10.930
-Do it!
-Do it!

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:14.270
That hurts!

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:35.370
Cognitive restrictionists would be shocked
if they heard about this.

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:37.290
They're probably mostly on my side now.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.790
Nasa,
please give up and turn yourself in.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.840
I know nearly everything
that's going to happen next.

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:45.670
There's no way I'll give up.

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:48.550
Konoha, Touya,

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:51.800
both of you are also part
of the Seven Poem.

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:55.060
-You'll understand that soon.
-Nasa, just stop already.

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:58.640
Listen.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:02.560
Both of you should understand
what these words mean.

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:07.070
Now is the dawn of a new era.

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:10.570
What are you saying?

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:13.070
The dawn of a new era?

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:16.120
The story of the end is finished.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:20.120
We will write the story of the beginning.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:24.790
The beginning is all there is--
a story without an ending.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:29.470
From this point on,
we humans will completely change.

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:30.550
SENDING E-MAILS

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:33.680
Whether or not you accept it,

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:36.890
you cannot escape the future any longer.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:46.150
I said that nobody would die today,
but that wasn't true.

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:47.820
Nasa.

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:50.990
It looks like the new god
also needs sacrifices.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:57.910
According to the Seven Poem,
there is one person who must depart today.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:15:59.950
Nasa! Stop!

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:02.580
At least there is
in the future that I know about.

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:03.830
E-MAILS SENT
AIR LOCK - OPEN

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.880
Nasa! Wait!

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:11.260
Nasa, no…

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:18.930
Touya!

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:20.020
Uncle.

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:23.600
Touya, Konoha.

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:26.230
You did great. And all of you as well.

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:33.900
This is just a piece of plastic
made by the 3D printer.

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:36.490
She was never planning on shooting anyone.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:39.080
Anyway, let's hurry back to the top.

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:41.700
I don't know if help will come.

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:48.210
Those patterns have even made it here.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:51.670
Yeah. They came up from the Moon floor.

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.050
Who's there?

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:00.220
That voice…

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:02.680
It was you, wasn't it?

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:04.310
Whatever the case,

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:07.400
we need to hurry
and connect Dark-Bright to the comet.

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:09.900
But the ICS antenna…

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:12.190
Are there no other options?

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:16.700
That will be difficult as long as UN2
has the communications block in place.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:18.700
THIS IS NOT THE STORY OF THE END
IT'S THE STORY OF THE BEGINNING

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:22.700
I'll try to persuade them.
However, I don't think I'll be able.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:23.700
Dark.

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:30.710
Dark, can you fix our implants?

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.300
They say it is not possible right now.

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:36.050
Why? Didn't we activate Lunatic?

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:40.600
Seven seems to have put some kind
of encryption into the implants.

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:44.220
Seven is probably the only one
who can solve this problem.

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:45.730
Encryption?

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:49.150
Why encrypt a half-melted implant?

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:53.230
It seems Seven did not merely
make a design flaw.

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:55.940
Touya, Konoha.

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:58.910
Have you been hearing things recently,
like hallucinations?

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:02.280
I don't really understand it either,

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:05.040
but it seems that inside
of the partially-melted implants,

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:07.250
a quantum communication function
has been actualized.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:11.420
The odds of this happening by coincidence
are seven in nine trillion.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.500
That means…

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:15.710
The only conclusion is that
they were designed that way to begin with.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:19.640
Seven intentionally did this
to the implants?

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:26.560
I see. So that was the future?

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.030
There's still a way.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:40.450
-Konoha!
-Konoha!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.120
Dakky.

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:51.960
Those patterns are actually connected
to that little one, aren't they?

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.210
Yes.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:57.800
Touya, do you remember
the voice we heard back then?

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:58.880
Back then?

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.890
Konoha, what are you thinking?

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:12.900
Dakky, go through my implant
and speak with the comet.

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:14.400
No, Konoha.

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:18.070
We are the only humans
that little one knows.

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.410
That voice we heard in the crater
back then--

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.580
when you took me on that adventure--

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.330
it was probably Seven's voice.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.580
Surely we've been connected
since that time.

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:35.840
No. Konoha, what are you doing?

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.880
Dakky, do you understand?

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:42.340
It seems that Dark understands
what to do somehow.

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:44.340
Connecting.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:47.850
-Konoha.
-It's okay.

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:50.350
Let's do it, Dakky.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.400
Connected.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:01.240
-Well?
-They're connected.

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:03.700
But perhaps it's wary
of the attack from before,

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:06.410
because it's not accepting any information
from outside its frame.

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:10.160
Touya and I have met Seven.

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:12.160
-What?
-What?

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.290
When we were little.

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:16.290
In Tateana City, on the moon's surface.

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:19.590
I see.

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:21.170
That voice.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:26.260
Probably since then,
Seven has wanted to learn about humans.

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:29.640
If it can remember us…

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:33.600
Then we should be
inside of the comet's frame too.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:40.110
It's connected.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.400
It remembers me.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.620
It's come to see me.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:57.920
It remembers me but still won't let me in.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.460
It's confused.

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:02.880
We're running out of time.

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:07.220
But that little one
wants to think about it some more.

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:11.560
It says it wants out of its cradle.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:12.640
Cradle?

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:16.140
It wants to know more.

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:19.150
It's as though it were a child.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:23.400
And it's saying that it wants
out of its closed-off world.

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:27.070
I see.

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:30.660
Why didn't we understand before?

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:33.950
I suddenly understand.

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:35.250
Konoha?

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:38.080
You're not supposed to suppress
a child's mind.

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:40.210
You're supposed to encourage it.

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.670
What does that mean?

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:45.170
It's going to unlock
the last cognitive limiter.

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:49.680
The limiter on Dark-Bright?

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:51.890
No. On the comet.

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:52.970
-What?
-What?

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:55.640
It's going to make it even smarter

00:21:55.730 --> 00:21:57.890
and have it think of the next part
of the Seven Poem.

00:21:57.980 --> 00:22:00.730
-The Seven Poem?
-The next part?

00:22:00.810 --> 00:22:02.570
But how?

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:06.110
The comet has already reached the most
advanced level of intelligence in history.

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:07.900
Surely there aren't any other limiters.

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:11.330
There is. The last one.

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:12.450
What?

00:22:12.530 --> 00:22:15.000
I see. The cognitive restrictions.

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:18.330
The cognitive restrictions
are like cradles for AIs.

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:19.710
Yes.

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:25.210
Second Seven has only received information
selected by John Doe.

00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:28.260
Like a safe cradle,

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:30.590
it learned with restricted cognition.

00:22:31.180 --> 00:22:33.600
So we'll show it everything?

00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:37.520
Yes. The comet is going to be
connected to the Internet.

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:39.100
It will be possible that way.

00:22:39.690 --> 00:22:41.650
What in the world are you talking about?

00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:43.150
Wait a minute.

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:46.280
Did you say you guys are going
to show the comet everything?

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:48.360
-And connect it to the net?
-That's right.

00:22:48.450 --> 00:22:52.740
You're going to show it fake news
and prejudiced stuff like that too?

00:22:52.820 --> 00:22:53.870
Drop dead, Earther!

00:22:53.950 --> 00:22:58.870
That's right. You're going to show it
the ugliest parts of the world on purpose?

00:22:59.460 --> 00:23:01.960
The world isn't ugly at all.

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:05.460
No matter what, we will keep you alive
and return you to Earth.

00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:08.090
I treated you guys like idiots
because you are Earthers,

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:10.130
but you're not so bad.

00:23:11.050 --> 00:23:15.010
If you only show a child things
that have been edited to your biases,

00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:17.100
will they grow up to be a good person?

00:23:17.770 --> 00:23:22.560
If you show them an unfiltered world,
will they grow up to be bad?

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:26.530
But if you show everything to a child
that doesn't understand yet…

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:30.780
Sure. If it's a stupid idiot child
that doesn't know anything.

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:33.370
Aren't you forgetting something?

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:37.790
Right now,
it's the smartest person in the world.

00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:40.870
I see.

00:23:41.870 --> 00:23:45.290
Let's show it everything,
good and bad, without editing.

00:23:45.380 --> 00:23:47.500
Interesting. I'm on board.

00:23:47.590 --> 00:23:48.670
Sounds good.

00:23:48.760 --> 00:23:50.970
Taiyou, is that okay?

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:53.300
Yeah. I permit everything.

00:23:53.390 --> 00:23:57.060
I'm going to break down the UN2
information blockade with full force.

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:03.560
-UN2 is screaming something at us.
-What?

00:24:03.650 --> 00:24:06.310
They're saying,
"Our AIs are powering down.

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:08.900
Is this your work?"

00:24:09.400 --> 00:24:10.690
What?

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:14.450
The UN2 information blockade
has been breached 40%.

00:24:14.530 --> 00:24:17.620
Sixty, 90--

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:19.950
-We've completely broken through.
-So fast!

00:24:20.040 --> 00:24:23.790
The comet Seven's intelligence
has increased three-fold.

00:24:24.330 --> 00:24:25.960
Four-fold, eight-fold.

00:24:26.540 --> 00:24:28.500
Updating to maximum level yet.

00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:32.470
The comet is reading the information
from the net with incredible speed.

00:24:33.340 --> 00:24:37.140
This is the last
real cognitive limiter unlocking.

00:24:37.970 --> 00:24:39.720
Leap out of that cradle!

00:24:45.850 --> 00:24:47.770
The line has connected.

00:24:47.860 --> 00:24:51.780
I'm riding the big wave.
I'll show everything, unedited.

00:24:51.860 --> 00:24:54.280
-TOUYA IS COOL
-THIS GUY IS PRETTY GOOD

00:24:54.360 --> 00:24:56.200
CURRENT FOLLOWER COUNT

00:24:56.780 --> 00:25:00.790
Unlimited Seven's intelligence
has surpassed all measurement.

00:25:01.450 --> 00:25:03.580
Unlimited Seven.

00:25:03.660 --> 00:25:05.210
Sounds ominous.

00:25:05.790 --> 00:25:08.710
I have one interesting
piece of information from Dark.

00:25:08.790 --> 00:25:09.710
What is it?

00:25:09.790 --> 00:25:13.840
It seems there is a mysterious ally
inside of Seven.

00:25:13.920 --> 00:25:15.760
It appears to be an AI.

00:25:15.840 --> 00:25:17.220
An AI?

00:25:17.300 --> 00:25:18.470
An ally?

00:25:19.050 --> 00:25:22.520
Dark doesn't seem to understand either.

00:25:23.100 --> 00:25:25.980
It's also persuading Second Seven,
just like we are.

00:25:27.770 --> 00:25:29.520
The persuasion has succeeded.

00:25:29.610 --> 00:25:32.280
-THE COMET'S ORBIT HAS CHANGED
-REALLY?

00:25:32.360 --> 00:25:35.030
The comet has shifted its course
away from direct impact.

00:25:35.110 --> 00:25:36.530
It's going into a circling orbit.

00:25:36.610 --> 00:25:39.780
It's still thinking. It seems uncertain.

00:25:40.620 --> 00:25:44.160
It will be fine, I'm sure of it.
That little one figured it out.

00:25:44.250 --> 00:25:45.290
Yeah.

00:25:46.370 --> 00:25:49.380
I wonder if humans have a Lunatic too.

00:25:51.130 --> 00:25:54.800
Right now,
my mind is somehow incredibly clear.

00:25:54.880 --> 00:25:55.880
Konoha?

00:25:56.470 --> 00:25:58.180
I understand everything.

00:25:58.260 --> 00:26:00.140
The past. The future.

00:26:00.220 --> 00:26:03.390
It's as though my implant has been fixed.

00:26:03.970 --> 00:26:07.390
Konoha, you should stop now.

00:26:16.110 --> 00:26:19.910
This was the right future after all.

00:26:29.000 --> 00:26:29.920
Konoha!

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:31.920
BLOOD PRESSURE AND PULSE FALLING
DIFFICULTY BREATHING

00:26:32.880 --> 00:26:33.920
Konoha.

00:26:35.840 --> 00:26:37.170
Konoha.

00:26:42.260 --> 00:26:44.390
I knew it.

00:26:44.970 --> 00:26:46.140
Konoha.

00:26:47.100 --> 00:26:50.940
What is happening today is something
that has always been predetermined.

00:26:51.020 --> 00:26:52.310
All of it.

00:26:53.440 --> 00:26:56.150
The implants did not have design flaws.

00:26:58.360 --> 00:27:01.240
The comet, the implants--

00:27:01.320 --> 00:27:03.200
they were created by Seven.

00:27:04.200 --> 00:27:08.540
To dissolve and stop was probably
exactly how Seven designed them.

00:27:09.370 --> 00:27:11.370
It knew this would happen

00:27:11.880 --> 00:27:14.130
and gave me this role.

00:27:14.210 --> 00:27:15.500
Konoha!

00:27:16.460 --> 00:27:19.800
It's strange. I understand everything.

00:27:19.880 --> 00:27:22.140
The past and the future.

00:27:25.060 --> 00:27:26.350
Touya,

00:27:26.890 --> 00:27:30.940
I… tried my best.

00:27:31.690 --> 00:27:32.690
Konoha.

00:27:34.900 --> 00:27:36.900
I…

00:27:39.070 --> 00:27:40.700
I'm scared.

00:27:42.780 --> 00:27:46.240
I don't want to die.

00:27:48.290 --> 00:27:53.290
I don't want to die yet.

00:27:57.880 --> 00:27:59.380
Wait. Don't go.

00:28:02.470 --> 00:28:05.390
I'm supposed to be
inside Seven's frame too.

00:28:05.470 --> 00:28:07.640
My implant's the same.

00:28:08.310 --> 00:28:10.140
Seven made it.

00:28:12.190 --> 00:28:13.190
We…

00:28:15.810 --> 00:28:17.730
We're not dying yet!

00:29:52.450 --> 00:29:55.870
Subtitle translation by
Noelle Marie Hollister:
